      "description": "BirdoVPN is a fast, privacy-first VPN with post-quantum protection built in.\n\nYour tunnel is secured with WireGuard and wrapped in a post-quantum key\nexchange (Rosenpass), so traffic captured today cannot be decrypted by a\nfuture quantum computer (\"harvest now, decrypt later\"). An optional stealth\ntransport helps the connection blend in on restrictive networks.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* WireGuard-based tunnel with a post-quantum key exchange layer\n* A reactive kill switch that blocks traffic if the tunnel drops\n* Split tunnelling \u2014 choose which apps use the VPN\n* A global network of servers with fast connect and one-tap switching\n* No activity logs; accounts can be created without an email address\n* DNS handled inside the tunnel to reduce leaks\n\nThis build is distributed outside Google Play and is signed with Birdo's own\nrelease key. It is the same APK published on GitHub Releases. A BirdoVPN\naccount is required to connect to the network.\n\nNote: the app bundles prebuilt native networking components (Xray and\nWireGuard-go), which is why it is served from this self-hosted repository\nrather than the main f-droid.org catalogue.",
